            "detail": "A data test states an expectation about the *rows* of a model — a package test (`dbt_utils.expression_is_true`), a singular test, or a generic test with no canonical analogue. The canonical model constrains shape, so the test is projected into the shared quality namespace FMT-5.1 defined (`extras['odcs_quality']`, in the ODCS `type: custom` rule shape with `engine: dbt`) on the model or the column that declared it, and is never executed, compiled, or turned into a constraint.",
